         which zero hung, the honest position is: the hang no longer reproduces
         and nothing here explains why it did. The obvious candidate -- that
         adding the check fixed it -- is not supported: it never triggered. The
         likelier story is that some other change between those builds moved the
         timing, since several landed in between, and that is a story rather
         than a measurement.
